  "albumInformation": "<p>The Mink Lungs have been providing a lotta love &amp; noise around Brooklyn for several years now. Their pop madness and rrrrrreal enthusiasm for everything they do is totally infectious. They shall soon take over the world, you just watch &amp; see!</p>\n<p>Here's who's lucky enough to say \"I'm in the Mink Lungs\": <br /> Giancarlo Feleppa - guitar, vocals, keyboards, minidisc &amp; Glove Compartment <br /> Tim Feleppa - guitar, vocals, keyboards, bass &amp; Tim <br /> Miss Frosty (Jen Hoopes) - bass, vocals, guitar &amp; Racquet <br /> Tom Galbraith - drums, vocals, Blank Stares</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.wfmu.org/playlists/shows/1359\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.wfmu.org/playlists/shows/1359</a></p>",
